Z||000003||Formula||03-07-2001||10:23 AM||||havent we had this rice discussion a million times.... these are in no way making my car look like its faster, in fact, I've never had anyone say anything negative about them in person, they shine red like normal fieros, they look ALOT better then normal fiero tailights (IMHO), and they arent like normal clear tailights, you cant see the bulbs, they shine very distinctly red, and they look like factory mustang tail lights (the deep look). This is all in my opinion, Im not flaming, and I dont mind the rice comments!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
