Z||000007||TwisT||03-07-2001||07:17 PM||||Here we go with the rice crap again!  PEOPLE,  GET OVER IT!!!  The rice thing is getting old.  Every person here who does ANYTHING to modify their Fiero in this forum ends up getting "riced" by the "anti-ricers,"  no matter how UNRICEY it may be.  <P>Now,  if it's a GReddy-sticker covered,  silly-ass wing wearin',  "I've got a Sony Playstation in my center console,"  grape-fruit shooting,  slammed-so-low it's scrapin' kind of Fiero,  then by all means,  RICE 'EM!!!  But ricing a guy just because he modifies his tailights to look better?  GIVE ME A BREAK!  Just because some modifications are popularized on "ricers" doesn't mean they are ineffective or "stupid" be used on American cars,  or for that matter,  exotics.  Anyone into car customizing knows this.  Not flaming here,  just want people to wake up a bit.<P>That being said,  nice job Formula,  I like the effect.  Definately better than the stockers IMHO.  Makes me wonder how effective it could be done on fastback tail lights...<P>Brett ||||reg||1
